1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,669
His thesis: most people tend to believe they are the centre of the world, and their culture is the linchpin of human history.

2
00:00:07,669 --> 00:00:12,747
A linchpin is the small pin through an axle that keeps the wheel from falling off.

3
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:16,536
Every group believes that its own culture is that pin.

